Package: com.huhansibuxin.universalnobgkeepalive
Name: UniversalNoBgKeepalive
Depends: mobilesubstrate, ellekit
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Universal no-background-keepalive. Hooks every iOS runtime channel
 that an app uses to stay alive in the background (beginBackgroundTask,
 BGTaskScheduler, PKPushRegistry/VoIP, CLLocationManager, background fetch,
 CBCentralManager restore, NSURLSession background, HKHealthStore delivery) and
 refuses/short-circuits them whenever the app is not in the foreground, so the
 system suspends it immediately after leaving. For static UIBackgroundModes,
 run the bundled strip_bg_modes.sh against the target bundle id.
Maintainer: huhansibuxin
Author: huhansibuxin
Section: Tweaks
